Matrix-Game 2 native training architecture
-----------------------------------------

Files under training/native_adapters/matrix_game2 (except __init__.py and the
WorldDistill attention binding) are adapted from Matrix-Game-2/wan/modules in:
https://github.com/SkyworkAI/Matrix-Game
Revision: 756776d516233027631008761d4d40ddaea3e23a
Copyright (c) 2025 SkyworkAI and contributors.
License: MIT, reproduced verbatim in training/native_adapters/matrix_game2/LICENSE.

WorldDistill modifications: package-relative imports; differentiable SDPA and
FlexAttention backend binding; device-portable rotary metadata; configurable
action rotary head size; full-clip mouse-window reshaping; correct batched
keyboard expansion; removal of fixed 880-token training assumptions; zero-pad
length handling; exclusion of padding keys from final partial causal chunks.
The parameterized architecture and native parameter/state names are preserved.
Inference-only KV-cache branches are not exposed by the training adapter.

LingBot-World camera-conditioned native architecture
---------------------------------------------------

training/native_adapters/lingbot/model.py is adapted from wan/modules/model.py:
https://github.com/Robbyant/lingbot-world
Revision: a43bec7f8091c83e9b30b16b912f6fc906236fa6
License: Apache License, Version 2.0, reproduced verbatim in
training/native_adapters/lingbot/LICENSE.

WorldDistill modifications: package-relative attention binding; differentiable
SDPA fallback; device-portable rotary metadata; activation checkpoint execution;
differentiable FP32 modulation/output linear arithmetic under BF16/FP16 storage.
The parameterized camera architecture and native parameter/state names are
preserved. The wrapper independently executes batch members to preserve the
author camera branch's per-sample semantics, and implements the published
relative-pose/origin-and-direction camera conditioning protocol.

Both architecture licenses are included in source and wheel distributions.
No pretrained weights, dataset media, or third-party training results are
redistributed with these architecture implementations.
